   "unmapped": [
    "Meta-learning: the learner faces m sequential tasks of n rounds each; task parameters mu_s ~ P_* = N(mu_*, v^2 Sigma_*) i.i.d., with mu_* ~ meta-prior Q = N(mu_Q, v^2 Sigma_Q)",
